  "description": "This library provides a powerful and intuitive toolkit for working with HTML documents within the .NET ecosystem, seamlessly bridging the gap between markup parsing and CSS style processing.\n\nKey Features:\n- HTML and CSS Integration: Extract, apply, and modify CSS styles directly within HTML tags (inline rendering) and manage layout constraints efficiently.\n- Flexible Navigation: Search and filter HTML elements using familiar CSS selector syntax or standard XPath queries.\n- DOM Manipulation: Dynamically update attributes, classes, inline styles, and inner text on the fly.\n- High Performance: Optimized for processing large-scale web pages and deeply nested document trees with low memory overhead.\n\nPerfect for web scraping, automated HTML report generation, content sanitization, and preparing HTML emails where precise inline CSS manipulation is required.",
  "id": "AspNet.VisualLightTags",
